+# Long-rental discount
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (days x daily price). Quotes and bookings
+show the reduced total. Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+
+## Open questions (to settle with /speckit-clarify)
+
+- Rounding: the 10% reduction can give a fraction of a cent. Implemented as rounding to the nearest cent
+  (`Math.round`) until the school decides otherwise.
